  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/commodities/materials/scrap-circuit-board.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>By spending 1 minute rigging an electronic console, access terminal, or power junction, you turn it into a dormant trap.</p><p>As a <strong>Reaction</strong> within 60 feet, you can detonate the terminal, forcing every creature within a <strong>10-foot radius</strong> to make a <strong>Dexterity saving throw</strong> against your Program Save DC. On a failure, a creature takes <strong>4d8 ion damage</strong> (or half as much on a success).</p>"
    },
